        "start_xml_ordinal": 20877,
        "body_paragraph_zero_based": 546,
        "direct_body_paragraph_zero_based": 496,
        "paragraph_id": "44033F3E",
        "text": "In (2.51) cS is the Smagorinsky constant (keyword: nuh), set at 0.1 in all model simulations. It is also possible to use a user-defined value for the horizontal viscosity by turning off the Smagorinsky model (keyword: smag = 0) and specifying the value directly (also keyword: nuh)."
      },
